# Upgrade project testing — remember these

Follow skill **`typo3-qa-clickup`** + **`CE-REAL-EDITOR.md`**. Load `projects/{slug}-intake.md` — never reuse another project’s theme, host, CE list, or ClickUp parent.

## CEs (real editor)

- One hidden QA page under **site root → misc**. Never pid 0 / outside root.
- One CE at a time: FormEngine fields → fill (FAL before image asserts) → save → reload → edit → FE.
- IRRE: **Create new** (exact), not Image “Create new relation”.
- File majors immediately (`find → Add → resume`). Prefer `fe-el-*.png` + URLs.

## ClickUp

- Issue body: Description / Steps / Actual / Expected / Environment / Evidence.
- **Plain text** in ClickUp (not markdown). Real @mention via API `tag` + user id, not `@Name` in the string.
- Evidence: screenshots **and** URLs. Forms test email when allowed: `sashaj850@gmail.com`.
- Assignee: intake developer (e.g. Heli `106831441`). No default — if unset, ask the user before filing.
- One parent QC/QA comment per batch. Token = session only; 401 → ask for a new token, draft in `reports/`.

## Retest + closeout

- When CE/FE/BE testing is done, **also retest issues assigned to Krishna** (`95011737`) in `testing` / resolved. Read developer comments first. Pass / not-a-bug → `Closed`. Fail → `in development` only if still broken.
- **Delete QA test pages in BE first**, then parent comment tagging **intake assignee (Heli) and Mahesh**: testing and bug review completed, ready for client update. Do not post complete while QA pages still exist.
